   "fix": "Say it is the element of the \u0393\u2080(N) Hecke ring \ud835\udd4b(\u0394\u2080(N), \u0393\u2080(N)) that acts as the classical T\u2099 on each fixed-character space through `heckeRingHomCharSpace k \u03c7` / `heckeRingHomCuspCharSpace k \u03c7`, with \u27e8p\u27e9 replaced by the scalar coset S_p.",
